k  it's necessary for them to learn this so  that it's something that is passing  because house I also find people playing  them so that is what that is how i also  got inspired john ripasso chino teaches  youth how to play these traditional  instruments free of charge he's  dedicated to upholding his grandmother's  cultural traditions today he performs  for audiences whenever he can to make  this ancient music popular once again
 

